<title>JAPAN: Japan MOF suspends most business of Hanwa Bank.</title>
<headline>Japan MOF suspends most business of Hanwa Bank.</headline>
<dateline>OSAKA 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Finance Ministry (MOF) said on Thursday that the ministry has suspended most business of Hanwa Bank Ltd, a major regional bank.</p>
</text>
